# Variance-fraction heatmaps

Small-multiple heatmaps of law-of-total-variance fractions (\(f_{W\mid\mathrm{seed}}\), \(f_\mu\), …) across CoV × \(r_h\) at fixed \(a_{hv}=10\).

- Source: `/mnt/box/GIG Lab - UC Berkeley/Projects/Statistical Analysis/complete/full_paper/figures/chi_variables/central_variability/cell_summary.csv`
- Cells in table: **243** (design expects 243)

## Reliability ceiling callout

From `reliability_ceiling.csv` (scope=full):

| Metric | \(R^2_{\mathrm{ceiling}}\) |
| --- | ---: |
| f_ratio | 0.2208 |
| abs_TF_ratio | 0.4636 |
| PGA_ratio | 0.6700 |
| PSA_ratio | 0.3771 |
| Ia_ratio | 0.7696 |

Ceiling is the population-information bound on design-only prediction of a single \(Y\) draw; within-cell noise (\(\approx f_{W\mid\mathrm{seed}}+f_\mu\) structure) is irreducible.

## Center slice (\(H=50\), \(V_{s1}=230\), \(a_{hv}=10\))

| Metric | med \(f_W\) | med \(f_\mu\) |
| --- | ---: | ---: |
| f_ratio | 0.106 | 0.894 |
| abs_TF_ratio | 0.120 | 0.880 |
| PGA_ratio | 0.687 | 0.313 |
| PSA_ratio | 0.629 | 0.371 |
| Ia_ratio | 0.768 | 0.232 |

